text:
I have a quick question about 70mm and Imax films. I want to see the new Oppenheimer in the best way possible. The AMC near me has two showings. One is "Imax Reimagined" and the other is "70mm". Which is better? Is the Imax reimagined still 70mm?

&amp;#x200B;

Thanks!

